  "content_html": "<div class=\"post-body entry-content\" id=\"post-body-483772165240278497\" itemprop=\"description articleBody\">\n<header class=\"sticky rtl\" role=\"banner\"><div class=\"logo-wrap\"><div class=\"box-shadow menu\"><div class=\"menu-row link\"><div class=\"d-block d-md-none col col-no-padding\"><div class=\"mobile-header ng-scope\" ng-controller=\"modechanger\"><div class=\"btn\"><br/></div> <a class=\"btn\" href=\"https://rattibha.com/search\"><i class=\"fas fa-search\"></i></a> <b>حينما يعيش الرحّال في خضم الجائحة فيبدع حداء ورجزا ونثرا وسجعا في أدب الرحلات… </b></div><div class=\"mobile-header ng-scope\" ng-controller=\"modechanger\"><b><br/></b></div><div class=\"mobile-header ng-scope\" ng-controller=\"modechanger\"><b>تفضلو من جميل نثري وخواطر حول السفر وكورونا </b></div><div class=\"mobile-header ng-scope\" ng-controller=\"modechanger\"><b>مع أخوكم وائل بن عبدالعزيز الدغفق </b></div><div class=\"mobile-header ng-scope\" ng-controller=\"modechanger\"><b>رحال الخبر1441هـ</b></div><div class=\"mobile-header ng-scope\" ng-controller=\"modechanger\"><br/></div></div></div></div><nav class=\"navbar navbar-expand-md navbar-light d-block d-md-none box-shadow rtl\"><div class=\"container\"></div></nav></div></header><div class=\"container\" id=\"main\"><section class=\"site-section py-sm mt-4 col-sm-10 col-lg-7 col-xs-10 col-md-8 mx-auto\"><div class=\"ng-scope\" keep-scroll-pos=\"\" ng-view=\"\" ng1-show=\"!view_loading &amp;&amp; !main_loading\"><div class=\"thread_page ng-scope\" id=\"thread_page\"><div class=\"row blog-entries\"><div class=\"col-xs-10 col-sm-10 col-md-11 col-lg-11 main-content rtl\" id=\"scrolldiv\" ng-class=\"getDirection(current_language)\" ng-show=\"!notfound\"><div class=\"post-meta p-1 col-md-12 mx-auto\" ng-show=\"!main_loading\"><span class=\"author row p-2\"><div class=\"d-flex ml-2 align-self-center\"><a href=\"https://rattibha.com/aldaqfaq\" ng-href=\"/aldaqfaq\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"mr-2\" ng-src=\"https://pbs.twimg.